* A jump back into earlier code: a dispatch loop
         MACRO
         DSP   &N
         LCLA  &I
&I       SETA  &N
         AIF   (&I GT 5).BIG
.TOP     ANOP
         DC    A(1)
         AIF   (&I EQ 1).MID
         DC    A(2)
.BIG     ANOP
         DC    A(3)
&I       SETA  1
         AGO   .TOP
.MID     ANOP
         DC    A(4)
         MEND
